      "provenance_score": 1.0,
      "content_sha256": "281f7f6c26e99ee220ddef166d51733f0bd087b219e3dc0c2395f274d962afff"
    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "The Newton-Raphson method obtains the REML estimate of the vector of parameters $ \\Theta $ by starting with some initial value $ \\Theta^{(0)} $ and then iterating to convergence to a final solution by using",
      "source_page": 806,
      "printed_page": 786,
      "source_block_ids": [
        "Genetics_chapter27:p016:b7"
      ],
      "bbox": [
        177.0,
