          310.0
        ]
      ],
      "provenance_score": 1.0,
      "content_sha256": "82690469ea6693726fedfc90f3706e54d7626f6bded3940079cd3c55e60cec64"
    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "Consider again the mixed model with m random factors plus a residual,",
