    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "Under REML, $ \\boldsymbol{\\Theta} = (\\sigma_{1}^{2}, \\sigma_{2}^{2}, \\cdots, \\sigma_{E}^{2})^{T} $ and Equations 27.14b and 27.27b give the elements of $ \\partial L/\\partial \\boldsymbol{\\Theta} $ as",
