    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "where $ V_i $ is given by Equation 27.15 and $ \\mathbf{P}^{(k)} $ is calculated from Equation 27.17b using the current variance-component estimates in $ \\boldsymbol{\\Theta}^{(k)} $. Searle et al. (1992) give the elements of $ \\mathbf{H} $ for REML as",
